Step-by-Step Reproduction Guide

1. Reproducing Table 1, Table 2 & Table 3 (Cross-Device & Temporal Analysis)
`c5_bucleMejor.m`: 
  * Computes the optimized baseline for $k$-NN across distance metrics, $k \in [1, 51]$, and weighting rules.
  * Outputs the baseline metrics for $k$-NN (C5) across `RAW_RAW`, `RAW_W1S`, `W1S_W1S`, and `W1S_RAW`.
`PIPELINE_OFICIAL.m`:
  * Loads database files (`*RTT_RAW_RAW_*.mat`, `*RTT_RAW_W1S_*.mat`, etc.) and executes DtC, Min-Max, and NORI (1.5).
  * Evaluates Fine Tree, Bagged Trees, SVM Gaussian, and Optimizable Tree.
  * Table 1 (Ablation / Preprocessing Gain): Compares raw burst performance against the full NORI (1.5) pipeline on `RAW_RAW`.
  * Table 2 (Temporal Aggregations): Combines the 4 database matrix variations for ML models alongside the $k$-NN baseline from `c5_bucleMejor.m`.
  * Table 3 (Accuracy vs. Latency Trade-Off): Captures offline training time and per-sample online inference time (ms/sample) under the optimal `RAW_W1S` configuration.

